WEBVTT

00:09:26.437 --> 00:09:30.024
The more women
see other women in public spaces,

00:09:30.024 --> 00:09:34.987
the more safe, independent
and empowered each one of us will be.

00:09:36.488 --> 00:09:37.865
So.

00:09:37.865 --> 00:09:43.078
If we can learn how to walk,
certainly we can learn how to fly.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.371
Thank you.

00:09:44.455 --> 00:09:51.420
(Applause)